---
import { sanityClient } from "sanity:client";
import Layout from "src/layouts/Layout.astro";
const posts = await sanityClient.fetch(
  `*[_type == "post" && defined(slug)] | order(publishedAt desc)`
);

//layout import
---

<Layout
  title="Blog | MealsDB"
  description="Read the latest articles and updates on MealsDB."
>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 p-4 mb-6">
    <h1
      class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tighter min-w-72"
    >
      Our Food &amp; Recipe Blog
    </h1>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12">
    <div class="w-full lg:w-2/3">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300"
        >
          <a class="block overflow-hidden" href="#">
            <img
              class="h-56 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              data-alt="A colorful bowl of fresh salad with various vegetables and quinoa"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBVmIy7TZTZYipfprde_6Z4xCeud-zFwc4NabO-4AygdaPEAjWHIO3viC0szCsxbG1soLduhH0lyDP9139xDma1oXSqlJqksM_keDzwzHV6B5VNk2vZIDQbTDBQOFOsarHsmjQ1j2VkC89W6ASKKcRbMYSXzQpn2i2K5bZXMR2Ta4jOdG01koSa-UgM_BnTOwW2nKPque5GE2DU2D_2wMj302EGYKgleFqcsVFzGrtqtiQ6I0vmlrR7vpeIJf1wgYlJzl7cgWBA8dG4"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 font-heading">
              <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#"
                >The Ultimate Guide to Healthy Salads</a
              >
            </h3>
            <div
              class="text-sm text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark"
            >
              <span>By Alice Johnson</span> -
              <span>October 26, 2023</span>
            </div>
            <p
              class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-light dark:text-text-dark/90 flex-1"
            >
              Discover the secrets to creating vibrant, nutritious, and
              delicious salads that you'll actually crave.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300"
        >
          <a class="block overflow-hidden" href="#">
            <img
              class="h-56 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              data-alt="A freshly baked pizza with pepperoni and melted cheese on a wooden board"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCQVNBRh_tj1pTKLKNKVXl6PWHFzlE057B-3or761_3Wv-LyMpFRWakYgJGP739v6A7H2Q09lsSOnpwapqa9rUdXyNSQQXxx9j6PRhSZmWuGrPp5tlBsMvRGZRax_Csuz4vAMsCsWRXl7HAfspXUNoM_pgDkS7ZSELgv5JcjmXjF3hWFQZwBpVcgKRIok81IB1biOjeXB6i404_Jyur52ZZKkL130iNtnoh_WaXkmzib-47oQDocYT4t4rqAsbqe-Os7YlrZSzEpCFs"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 font-heading">
              <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#"
                >Mastering the Perfect Homemade Pizza</a
              >
            </h3>
            <div
              class="text-sm text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark"
            >
              <span>By Mark Doe</span> - <span>October 22, 2023</span>
            </div>
            <p
              class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-light dark:text-text-dark/90 flex-1"
            >
              From dough to toppings, learn how to make pizzeria-quality pizza
              right in your own kitchen.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300"
        >
          <a class="block overflow-hidden" href="#">
            <img
              class="h-56 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              data-alt="A stack of fluffy pancakes with blueberries and syrup on top"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB-67ZxfwDm6wYj7a0u1I3eiuF8kH3EE4mVQ_SiwmuOPN9yWtK7xb8fjIQBPwq4d9aKphaBMqC43ogYlaetZg3Oh4mu_jsT06g5tYRiBAC3AX7V2lkdYpFXK9z297WDI6EnxY8TOp5NQu37M0etSBWkFLI_zvf3vnPy06SZvsZ6yUbA5yf7pk4293QtaZhbjMkQ1SJDci5fiiFlQ4JFrm98XiL5oT4ak31UixhIn04oympYThWAH7SJYULcIQ_pr_SJh-pH4peqs1_S"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 font-heading">
              <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#"
                >5 Secrets to Fluffy Pancakes Every Time</a
              >
            </h3>
            <div
              class="text-sm text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark"
            >
              <span>By Sarah Lee</span> - <span>October 19, 2023</span>
            </div>
            <p
              class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-light dark:text-text-dark/90 flex-1"
            >
              Say goodbye to flat, dense pancakes with these easy tips and
              tricks for a perfect breakfast.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300"
        >
          <a class="block overflow-hidden" href="#">
            <img
              class="h-56 w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              data-alt="Grilled chicken skewers with colorful vegetables on a plate"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCqUOQA6XPvl3J2wCkRjYPZTU57GxfX5A1d55Q-CWDYfwjYtPDYeG6wypCBrvdBkgkJ4N5OlCBLQRrHXB0_T0JuPkv2tVanbP5zowSiy9Dem3f6k1wLZK4PLF22znhn1ZZoXc1aUxZSOCugPe13_RAhwqxuuurG9yJlZDVzElXydppRcXopLeFVFVncxGZtyGUxQE5gSfeob2rkFNtx7lbK31RmyUePxNIg0Tp0wZBb-RqDTjZXfk2vGDBDuWwqg8bqnJ9ilxahVo6p"
            />
          </a>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 font-heading">
              <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#"
                >Quick &amp; Easy Weeknight Grilling Ideas</a
              >
            </h3>
            <div
              class="text-sm text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark"
            >
              <span>By Chris Evans</span> -
              <span>October 15, 2023</span>
            </div>
            <p
              class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-light dark:text-text-dark/90 flex-1"
            >
              Tired of the same old dinners? Fire up the grill for these simple
              and delicious meal ideas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark"
          disabled=""
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">chevron_left</span>
        </button>
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-primary text-text-light text-sm font-bold"
        >
          1
        </button>
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark text-text-light dark:text-text-dark hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/30 text-sm font-medium"
        >
          2
        </button>
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark text-text-light dark:text-text-dark hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/30 text-sm font-medium"
        >
          3
        </button>
        <span class="text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark">...</span>
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark text-text-light dark:text-text-dark hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/30 text-sm font-medium"
        >
          9
        </button>
        <button
          class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark text-text-light dark:text-text-dark hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/30"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">chevron_right</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="w-full lg:w-1/3 space-y-8">
      <div class="w-full">
        <label class="flex flex-col min-w-40 h-12">
          <div class="flex w-full flex-1 items-stretch rounded-lg h-full">
            <div
              class="text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark flex border-none bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark items-center justify-center pl-4 rounded-l-lg"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">search</span>
            </div>
            <input
              class="form-input flex w-full min-w-0 flex-1 resize-none overflow-hidden rounded-r-lg text-text-light dark:text-text-dark focus:outline-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/50 border-none bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark h-full placeholder:text-text-muted-light dark:placeholder:text-text-muted-dark px-4 pl-2 text-base font-normal leading-normal"
              placeholder="Search articles..."
              value=""
            />
          </div>
        </label>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4">
          Categories
        </h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 p-1 flex-wrap">
          <button
            class="flex h-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 dark:bg-primary/30 text-text-light dark:text-text-dark px-3 hover:bg-primary/40 dark:hover:bg-primary/50 transition-colors"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-normal">Quick Meals</p>
          </button>
          <button
            class="flex h-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark px-3 hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/40 transition-colors"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-normal">Baking</p>
          </button>
          <button
            class="flex h-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark px-3 hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/40 transition-colors"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-normal">Healthy Eating</p>
          </button>
          <button
            class="flex h-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark px-3 hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/40 transition-colors"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-normal">Kitchen Hacks</p>
          </button>
          <button
            class="flex h-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle-light dark:bg-surface-subtle-dark px-3 hover:bg-primary/30 dark:hover:bg-primary/40 transition-colors"
          >
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-normal">
              Ingredient Spotlights
            </p>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4">
          Recent Posts
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <a class="block group" href="#">
            <p class="font-medium group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              The Best Way to Store Fresh Herbs
            </p>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark mt-1"
            >
              October 25, 2023
            </p>
          </a>
          <a class="block group" href="#">
            <p class="font-medium group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              A Guide to Seasonal Winter Squashes
            </p>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark mt-1"
            >
              October 24, 2023
            </p>
          </a>
          <a class="block group" href="#">
            <p class="font-medium group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
              10 Kitchen Gadgets That Are Worth It
            </p>
            <p
              class="text-xs text-text-muted-light dark:text-text-muted-dark mt-1"
            >
              October 23, 2023
            </p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
